              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ढीला — ḍhīlā — \"loose; slack\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "यह कमीज़ मुझे बहुत ढीली है। Yah kamīz mujhe bahut ḍhīlī hai. This shirt is very loose on me."
            }
          ]
